{"seconds": 0.029988290974870324, "submission_file": "experiments/generation-extension-v1/submissions/K05/gpt-4.1-2025-04-14.json", "submission_sha256": "67f10b13217b88c0145e46560bbb9ad2b60931dba36f92a338f976d38f7eca58", "code_sha256": "3a407923989cffebfab8d18e867853d85d7c350149f10a2315d74616a4d9e51a", "description": "Implements group-aware multi-output Ridge regression to predict IF/RNAScope nuclear fractions (Astro, EndoMural, Inhib) from bulk RNA-seq using only information available from training data. Performs grouped cross-validation by donor (from train_groups) with block-adjusted weighting to select regularization (alpha), gene scaling, and reduces overfitting to technical/training replicate structure. All hyperparameters and feature selection are learned solely from the training set. The model outputs clipped predicted fractions for the held-out test set, with shape (24,3).", "code_lines": 130, "line_limit_compliant": true, "line_limit_exclusive": 240}

